<title>CHINA: U.S. INSURER CIGNA OPENS CHINA REP OFFICE.</title>
<headline>U.S. INSURER CIGNA OPENS CHINA REP OFFICE.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. insurer Cigna Corp has opened a representative office in China's booming southern city of Guangzhou and has already set up similar offices in Beijing and Shanghai, the China Daily said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The office will collect insurance-related data on China and hopes in the future to gain a share in the insurance market in southern China, the newspaper quoted company officials as saying.</p>
